          <td class="docs">
            <p><em>Kanallar</em> — bu parallel goroutinalarni bir-biriga
bog&rsquo;laydigan quvurlardir. Bir goroutinadan kanallarga
qiymat jo&rsquo;natib, o&rsquo;sha qiymatlarni boshqa goroutinada
qabul qilishingiz mumkin.</p>

          </td>
          <td class="code empty leading">
            
          
          </td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td class="docs">
            
          </td>
          <td class="code leading">
